{"id":"d5bc3d5ff97b8f74","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-canonical-model.md","title":"Theoremhood in the Canonical Model","display":"thm-canonical-model — Theoremhood in the Canonical Model","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-canonical-model","aliases":["89-thm-canonical-model"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-canonical-model — Theoremhood in the Canonical Model","depends_on":["[[89-lem-canonical-truth]]","[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-canonical-model — Theoremhood in the Canonical Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ba20ee86fa7998c\" href=\"?note=5ba20ee86fa7998c\" title=\"89-lem-canonical-truth\">89-lem-canonical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"646a96fe655f6d74\" href=\"?note=646a96fe655f6d74\" title=\"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal\">89-lem-lindenbaum-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92c4449a6fa3b997\" href=\"?note=92c4449a6fa3b997\" title=\"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties\">89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)\">\\(\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_L\\)</span> 为局部一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\nA\\in L\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\Gamma\\in W_L\\;(\\mathcal M_L,\\Gamma\\models A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\nA\\in L\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\Gamma\\in W_L\\;(\\mathcal M_L,\\Gamma\\models A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 87；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>定理属于每个极大一致集，再用真值引理。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\notin L\">\\(A\\notin L\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\neg A\\}\">\\(\\{\\neg A\\}\\)</span> 一致；否则有限见证的否定用经典命题逻辑推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in L\">\\(A\\in L\\)</span>。扩张此集合为典范世界，真值引理在该世界反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。这不要求框架适合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的全部公理；第 6 章 p.90–91 特别解释了 GL 的例外。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-canonical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"5ba20ee86fa7998c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-canonical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal","status":"resolved","id":"646a96fe655f6d74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties","status":"resolved","id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_L=(W_L,R_L,V_L)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\nA\\in L\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\Gamma\\in W_L\\;(\\mathcal M_L,\\Gamma\\models A).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\neg A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1188,"backlinks":[{"id":"570349aa538831d0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"852a0356bca26d3a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["5ba20ee86fa7998c","646a96fe655f6d74","92c4449a6fa3b997"]}